WEBVTT

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:04.550
So basically, since this 
is like this, I do this...

00:00:08.080 --> 00:00:10.500
This just won't soak in at all!

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:11.780
What do I do?

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.450
Our achievement tests 
are right around the corner!

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.700
What am I gonna do?!

00:00:19.190 --> 00:00:21.740
Sometimes you just need a change of pace.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.250
What the heck are you doing?

00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:30.590
Prince Alan! Perfect timing!

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.510
Here. This is for you.

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.920
It can't go out to market, 
but it's still edible.

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:37.550
Should you be doing this 
right before the test?

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.730
It'll be fine!

00:00:38.730 --> 00:00:42.050
The test results have nothing to do 
with my doom flags.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:43.350
Doom flags?

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:46.020
Uh... Never mind!

00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.030
Lady Catarina and Prince Alan?

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:01.970
Why are they together 
during our study period?

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:03.370
Don't tell me—

00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:05.630
No, that simply couldn't be.

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:10.200
I've done so much to squash 
any chance of that happening.

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:12.410
Still, I have to get between them!

00:01:18.740 --> 00:01:20.270
Oh, Mary!

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.860
Would you like to study with me?

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:24.770
What?! You really want me to?

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:27.430
Yeah. I'm done working in the fields,

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:29.560
and I wasn't getting 
anywhere studying alone.

00:01:30.160 --> 00:01:31.140
I will!

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.330
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:07.490
<b>Episode 8 
I Became Engulfed by Desire...</b>

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:07.860
<i>I can't believe Lady Catarina 
asked me to study with her.</i>

00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:10.420
<i>And she's sitting so close to me!</i>

00:03:10.420 --> 00:03:11.380
Mary...

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:14.130
I don't know how to do this one.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:16.430
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:03:16.430 --> 00:03:19.400
I don't know how to do that one, either.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:22.210
Maybe we should ask the president, then.

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.640
And that's how you arrive at the answer.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:28.750
Oh, I get it!

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:31.610
I understand now. 
You're a great teacher, President Sirius.

00:03:31.930 --> 00:03:36.540
There are several reference books 
on this in the east building's library.

00:03:36.540 --> 00:03:39.700
They're available to borrow, 
so maybe you should go there.

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:43.030
We'll do that, President. Thank you!

00:03:45.420 --> 00:03:47.600
I'm honored that I could be of help.

00:03:48.860 --> 00:03:51.180
The library in the east building...

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:52.910
I've never been there before.

00:03:52.910 --> 00:03:54.350
Neither have I.

00:03:54.350 --> 00:03:57.080
I guess it's different
from the usual library.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:58.080
Hello.

00:03:59.090 --> 00:04:00.710
Where are you two headed?

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:02.920
Prince Geordo, how do you do?

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:05.530
We're on our way to 
the library in the east building.

00:04:05.530 --> 00:04:06.820
That's perfect.

00:04:06.820 --> 00:04:09.260
I was thinking of going there myself.

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:10.190
May I join you?

00:04:10.190 --> 00:04:11.690
Of course.

00:04:11.930 --> 00:04:14.030
Mary, do you take issue with that?

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:16.940
N-Not at all. Please, do accompany us.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:21.570
<i>Just when I thought I'd get some 
time alone with Lady Catarina...</i>

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:23.510
Sister, where are you off to?

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:24.740
The library.

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:27.650
Oh? Maybe I'll come with you.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.710
The library? What a coincidence.

00:04:31.710 --> 00:04:32.910
I'm going there, too.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:34.790
I'll join you, too!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.900
Oh! I'd love to join you!

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:42.930
<i>Everyone ended up joining us...</i>

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.510
Darn it all!

00:04:47.980 --> 00:04:51.210
Please, Lady Catarina, 
have a seat right here.

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:53.120
I'll sit next to you.

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:03.200
I-I'm sorry! I guess I'm a little hungry...

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:05.090
Shall I go and get some sweets?

00:05:05.090 --> 00:05:06.530
Thanks, Maria!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.890
I-I'll help you.

00:05:08.890 --> 00:05:11.360
I'll bring the best tea you've ever had.

00:05:11.360 --> 00:05:12.700
Thanks, Mary!

00:05:14.200 --> 00:05:15.760
Just leave it to me!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.880
<i>It all looks like sweets!</i>

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.370
Did this just shine for a second?

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:49.600
What's going on?!

00:05:49.600 --> 00:05:50.950
I-It's so bright...

00:05:51.290 --> 00:05:52.950
What is that light?

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.330
Did you see that?

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:14.850
Yes...

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.230
They all just disappeared...

00:06:17.840 --> 00:06:20.200
...into the book?

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:28.530
This is ancient script.

00:06:28.530 --> 00:06:31.690
It says... "A Tale by the Name of..."

00:06:31.690 --> 00:06:33.230
..."Desire"?

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.740
"When one's desire is fulfilled..."

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:39.620
"...those captured may be saved."

00:06:40.530 --> 00:06:42.180
Let's try and read it.

00:06:42.180 --> 00:06:43.040
Right.

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.950
Lady Catarina?!

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:53.470
Lady Catarina!

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:55.550
Is this...

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.930
the world within the book?

00:07:00.130 --> 00:07:04.080
It looks like we can't interfere 
with the world in the book.

00:07:04.080 --> 00:07:06.540
What in the world is going on?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:12.570
Come, this way.

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:16.500
Why am I dressed like this?

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.910
I was just in the library a moment ago...

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:32.590
Well, now that the wedding is over,

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:36.090
you finally belong to me alone.

00:07:36.090 --> 00:07:37.590
Wedding?

00:07:37.590 --> 00:07:39.690
So this is a wedding dress?!

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:42.640
No one will be coming here 
for the rest of the night.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:51.620
You'll be alone with me until morning.

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:54.040
What?! I can't do that!

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:56.610
I have to study for my test!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:08:00.650
Your face couldn't possibly look any cuter.

00:08:01.270 --> 00:08:04.020
It makes me want to make 
you even more uncomfortable.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.330
U-Um... Prince Geordo?

00:08:17.240 --> 00:08:21.560
Shall I start by taking those lips of yours?

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:32.030
H-Honestly, I'd prefer 
some sweets over wine...

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:36.050
Wh-What in the world is going on here?!

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.370
I can't bear to see any more!

00:08:38.520 --> 00:08:42.490
Prince Geordo, what do you think 
you're doing to my Lady Catarina?!

00:08:42.490 --> 00:08:45.370
Was that an illusion the book 
was showing us?

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.880
Or is it really happening inside the book?

00:08:48.880 --> 00:08:52.510
Whether it's real or an illusion, 
I won't stand for it!

00:08:52.630 --> 00:08:56.400
What can I do to rescue Lady Catarina?

00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.440
Let's open the book one more time.

00:09:05.080 --> 00:09:06.700
Sister, wake up.

00:09:07.720 --> 00:09:09.070
Keith...

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:12.030
Come on, pick up your pen 
and face your desk.

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:17.290
Huh? I'm suddenly back in my own room?

00:09:22.370 --> 00:09:23.890
<i>Wh-What is this?</i>

00:09:23.890 --> 00:09:25.890
<i>Keith is acting weird today!</i>

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:28.040
<i>And he's giving off an oddly sexy vibe...</i>

00:09:28.610 --> 00:09:30.850
You'd better get your studying done...

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:35.530
or I'll eat this.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:39.900
My sweets! Give that to me!

00:09:39.900 --> 00:09:42.670
Then... open wide.

00:09:42.670 --> 00:09:43.350
Huh?!

00:09:44.490 --> 00:09:47.520
"Ah..."

00:09:50.700 --> 00:09:53.150
Ah...

00:09:53.150 --> 00:09:55.780
No!

00:09:55.780 --> 00:09:59.240
I absolutely, positively won't 
let anyone feed Lady Catarina!

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.420
It was a story about Master Keith 
and Lady Catarina this time...

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:06.690
"A Tale by the Name of Desire"...

00:10:06.690 --> 00:10:10.090
So that was Prince Geordo's 
desire we saw before,

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:12.560
and this was Master Keith's desire?

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:13.250
Huh?!

00:10:13.560 --> 00:10:16.670
Come to think of it, I do remember hearing

00:10:16.670 --> 00:10:18.380
that somewhere in this school,

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:21.660
there's a magic book 
that craves the desires of humans.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:24.610
I've heard that before, too.

00:10:24.610 --> 00:10:27.860
It was one of this school's seven mysteries.

00:10:28.090 --> 00:10:31.920
This book was written long 
before this school was established,

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:34.450
but it looks like a brand new book...

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:38.440
and that's because it prolongs its 
life by feeding on human desires

00:10:38.440 --> 00:10:40.010
as its energy source.

00:10:43.290 --> 00:10:46.800
Hey! What do we have to do 
to get them all out of you?!

00:10:48.750 --> 00:10:50.370
Tell me!

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.620
Miss Mary, please, calm down!

00:10:54.060 --> 00:10:55.260
In the preface, it says,

00:10:55.260 --> 00:10:59.090
"When one's desire is fulfilled, 
those captured may be saved."

00:10:59.700 --> 00:11:02.480
So if the desire of one 
of the people in it is fulfilled,

00:11:02.480 --> 00:11:05.560
they would all be able to 
return here, right?

00:11:05.560 --> 00:11:10.320
You mean they all have to 
live out their desires in full?

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:11.270
Wait!

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:14.290
They all love Lady Catarina,

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:16.900
which means their desires would be...

00:11:17.160 --> 00:11:20.940
to do all kinds of things to Lady Catarina?!

00:11:21.100 --> 00:11:23.380
No way!

00:11:24.650 --> 00:11:26.520
No way!

00:11:26.520 --> 00:11:28.990
Well, we need to open the 
book, or nothing will...

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:31.920
No! I don't want to see any of that!

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:36.290
But if we don't, they'll all 
be trapped in the book forever!

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.590
I know, but...

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.520
It's all right, Miss Mary.

00:11:42.520 --> 00:11:44.190
I'm here with you.

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.180
We may be in a bad situation,

00:11:46.180 --> 00:11:49.400
but let's work together 
to find the best way to fix it.

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:50.670
Miss Maria...

00:11:54.540 --> 00:11:58.460
Lady Catarina, I've found 
another interesting book.

00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:01.830
Wow, all of these look interesting!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:02.740
Wait... huh?

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.120
Why am I in your personal library?

00:12:06.120 --> 00:12:07.670
Don't you like it?

00:12:07.820 --> 00:12:09.580
Oh, I do!

00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:12.050
All the books in here 
are books I'd love to read!

00:12:12.050 --> 00:12:13.420
I wish I could live here!

00:12:14.120 --> 00:12:17.130
Lady Catarina... O-Of course!

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.550
I'm prepared...

00:12:22.990 --> 00:12:25.450
to start living with you at any time!

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.150
S-Sophia?

00:12:27.310 --> 00:12:32.190
Because, Lady Catarina, I...

00:12:32.190 --> 00:12:35.060
l-lo... lo...

00:12:35.200 --> 00:12:36.940
I love you, too, Sophia!

00:12:37.150 --> 00:12:38.530
You mean it?!

00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:42.160
How much?! Which do you 
love more, me or sweets?!

00:12:42.160 --> 00:12:45.410
Huh? W-Well, of course, I...

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:53.820
I can't believe Lady Sophia slammed 
Lady Catarina against a wall!

00:12:53.820 --> 00:12:56.240
She even told her she l-loved her...

00:12:56.240 --> 00:12:58.040
The next one! Let's try the next one!

00:13:00.090 --> 00:13:03.230
What's all this? Where am I this time?

00:13:06.930 --> 00:13:08.900
May I have this dance?

00:13:17.110 --> 00:13:18.740
<i>Who are you?</i>

00:13:19.890 --> 00:13:22.620
<i>Black hair, black eyes...</i>

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:24.430
<i>And the way he's dressed...</i>

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:29.290
<i>Is this... the Devilish Count?</i>

00:13:32.190 --> 00:13:33.410
Nicol?!

00:13:34.100 --> 00:13:35.550
It's Master Nicol!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:40.420
Master Nicol!

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:44.220
What now?

00:13:58.470 --> 00:14:00.550
We're saved!

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:04.880
Um, Master Nicol, which way is the school?

00:14:04.880 --> 00:14:07.160
I need to get back to the library.

00:14:07.660 --> 00:14:09.360
I'm hungry, too.

00:14:20.260 --> 00:14:22.220
I don't want to let you go.

00:14:23.380 --> 00:14:25.300
I want to keep you...

00:14:25.910 --> 00:14:27.570
trapped in these arms forever.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:32.370
Let's burn this book!

00:14:32.370 --> 00:14:34.150
Miss Mary, please calm down!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:36.970
Are these things really 
what they're all thinking?!

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:40.690
It may be that the magic 
is making their desires rage out of control!

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:44.650
We still have to see more?! 
Wasn't that enough?!

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:48.860
It looks like that wasn't enough.

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.420
If that's what it wants...

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:54.540
I'll face down this desire 
or whatever else it wants me to!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.160
Miss Mary?

00:15:04.160 --> 00:15:08.210
After all this, I don't even need to read it. 
I can guess what's going to happen.

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:10.180
This is just awful...

00:15:10.850 --> 00:15:14.760
But the one it's hurting 
the most is Lady Catarina.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:17.500
She left all these sweets here, untouched.

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:20.280
And I'm sure she must 
be quite hungry by now...

00:15:21.930 --> 00:15:23.260
That's it!

00:15:23.260 --> 00:15:27.560
None of the stories we've seen so far 
have been about Lady Catarina's desire.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.830
Yes, you're right.

00:15:30.100 --> 00:15:34.360
"When one's desire is fulfilled, 
those captured may be saved."

00:15:34.360 --> 00:15:37.550
So if Lady Catarina's desire is fulfilled...

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:39.340
They'll all be set free!

00:15:39.660 --> 00:15:42.600
We'll just have to stake 
all our hopes on that!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.750
I'm so hungry.

00:15:48.750 --> 00:15:51.640
How do I get back to the library?

00:15:51.640 --> 00:15:54.560
I want to eat Maria's sweets!

00:15:54.560 --> 00:15:56.800
I want to drink Mary's tea!

00:15:56.910 --> 00:15:59.240
Lady Catarina, the sweets are right here!

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:01.090
And so is the tea!

00:16:01.090 --> 00:16:04.020
It's a pity we can't bring them to her.

00:16:06.300 --> 00:16:08.450
Sweets!

00:16:09.840 --> 00:16:14.180
Wow! The whole thing is made of sweets!

00:16:16.270 --> 00:16:17.960
Yum!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:23.080
This is great!

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:27.990
<i>Incredible!</i>

00:16:27.990 --> 00:16:29.720
<i>I can still eat more!</i>

00:16:29.720 --> 00:16:31.560
<i>I can eat all I want!</i>

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:33.730
<i>Strange...</i>

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:35.840
<i>No matter how much I eat, it's not enough.</i>

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:38.300
<i>I want more! More, more!</i>

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:40.210
<i>More! More! More!</i>

00:16:40.210 --> 00:16:41.630
<i>More! More! More!</i>

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.360
<i>More! More! More! More! More! More!</i>

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:44.650
<i>More! More! More! More! More! More!</i>

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:46.610
<i>More! More! More!</i>

00:17:02.720 --> 00:17:04.590
Wh-What's happening?

00:17:13.550 --> 00:17:15.420
Something is clearly wrong!

00:17:15.420 --> 00:17:16.640
We should close the book!

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:42.080
Is everyone all right?

00:17:42.080 --> 00:17:43.260
Yeah...

00:17:43.260 --> 00:17:44.700
Ow...

00:17:44.700 --> 00:17:51.170
More... More... More... More...

00:17:55.180 --> 00:17:57.490
Yummy...

00:17:59.810 --> 00:18:02.390
Lady Catarina!

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:03.980
Mary?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:10.540
Um, so you're saying...

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:13.990
...this book, which is one 
of the school's seven mysteries...

00:18:13.990 --> 00:18:16.280
...sucked us up and trapped us inside?

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:16.950
Yes.

00:18:17.140 --> 00:18:19.980
Oh, so it's a magic book!

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:22.660
No wonder all those weird 
things kept happening.

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:25.370
Tales of desire?

00:18:25.820 --> 00:18:27.280
Desire...

00:18:29.570 --> 00:18:33.240
Desire... is most definitely what that was.

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:35.480
Uh, I need to get going.

00:18:35.480 --> 00:18:36.680
I must go, as well.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:38.150
Me, too.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:46.490
You all seem awfully embarrassed 
now that you're back in the real world.

00:18:46.490 --> 00:18:48.970
Embarrassed? What do you mean?

00:18:49.280 --> 00:18:51.500
What happened inside that book?

00:18:51.500 --> 00:18:53.860
All I did was play the piano.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:56.230
And that's all you need 
to know, Prince Alan.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:03.330
Anyway, this book looked as though it 
were in pain at the end of all that.

00:19:03.410 --> 00:19:05.700
This just occurred to me...

00:19:05.700 --> 00:19:08.340
The world inside the book 
is fictional, right?

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:13.210
So no matter how many sweets Lady 
Catarina ate, she'd never feel full.

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:15.420
How strange!

00:19:15.530 --> 00:19:17.690
I keep eating and eating, 
but it's not enough!

00:19:18.390 --> 00:19:21.550
I think Lady Catarina's desire 
just kept growing bigger,

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:24.260
until the book couldn't contain it anymore.

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.140
I see!

00:19:26.140 --> 00:19:31.370
So does that mean Lady Catarina 
is stronger than the book's magic?

00:19:31.580 --> 00:19:32.340
Yes!

00:19:32.340 --> 00:19:34.480
That's my Lady Catarina!

00:19:41.730 --> 00:19:45.530
<i>This is bliss!</i>

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:29.520
Oh, darn it!

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:32.520
I just can't resist!

00:21:35.780 --> 00:21:39.360
Standing on grass just feels so good!

00:21:40.690 --> 00:21:42.450
You're barefoot?!

00:21:43.220 --> 00:21:45.190
You know...

00:21:45.190 --> 00:21:48.240
that's not something a noble lady should do.

00:21:48.420 --> 00:21:51.240
Aw, but it feels really nice.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:53.320
You should try it, too.

00:21:59.760 --> 00:22:01.980
Wow, that does feel nice.

00:22:03.620 --> 00:22:05.080
Hey, Catarina?

00:22:05.080 --> 00:22:06.680
Hey!

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:09.430
Up here!

00:22:11.890 --> 00:22:14.580
Why are you climbing a tree again?

00:22:14.580 --> 00:22:16.400
You're not a child!

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:19.190
It's been so long since I climbed 
one, so I wanted to try it.

00:22:19.190 --> 00:22:21.660
Why don't you join me, Prince Alan?

00:22:21.660 --> 00:22:25.240
The view from up here is really pretty!

00:22:27.570 --> 00:22:31.320
Seriously... What am I going to do with you?

00:22:35.940 --> 00:22:37.170
Welcome!

00:22:44.280 --> 00:22:45.840
I had forgotten...

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:48.970
Just seeing it from a different spot

00:22:49.860 --> 00:22:52.820
makes the world look so different.

00:22:55.460 --> 00:22:56.800
Pretty, isn't it?

00:23:02.450 --> 00:23:04.310
Y-Yeah...

00:23:15.010 --> 00:23:18.320
I wish time would stop right now.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:21.240
Lady Catarina?

00:23:21.240 --> 00:23:22.880
Where could she be?

00:23:23.990 --> 00:23:25.210
Prince Alan?!

00:23:25.390 --> 00:23:27.550
Is this another tale of desire?

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:29.350
No, it's not!

00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:32.010
This is the real world!

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:34.930
Don't! Don't even think about it!

00:23:35.250 --> 00:23:38.130
I have to get between them!
